<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>For My Gorgeous Darling ❤️</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #ff1e56;
      --accent: #ff0055;
      --bg: #0a0308;
      --card-bg: rgba(20, 5, 15, 0.85);
      --text: #fbebf2;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .glow {
      position: fixed;
      width: 320px;
      height: 320px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 30, 86, 0.25) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .bg-particles {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .particle {
      position: absolute;
      font-size: 22px;
      animation: floatUp 5s linear infinite;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    @keyframes floatUp {
      0% {
        transform: translateY(105vh) scale(0.6) rotate(0deg);
        opacity: 0;
      }
      40% {
        opacity: 0.9;
      }
      100% {
        transform: translateY(-10vh) scale(1.3) rotate(25deg);
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }

    .card {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      background: var(--card-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 30, 86, 0.4);
      padding: 35px 25px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      max-width: 480px;
      width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255, 30, 86, 0.3);
    }

    .central-glow {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      background-color: var(--primary);
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px 5px rgba(255, 30, 86, 0.7);
      animation: pulsate 2s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes pulsate {
      0% { transform: scale(0.9); box-shadow: 0 0 20px 5px rgba(255, 30, 86, 0.7); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.1); box-shadow: 0 0 35px 10px rgba(255, 30, 86, 0.9); }
      100% { transform: scale(0.9); box-shadow: 0 0 20px 5px rgba(255, 30, 86, 0.7); }
    }

    h1 {
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 30, 86, 0.6);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    p.tagline {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #e2b4c7;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .music-control {
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .music-btn {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--primary);
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 8px 18px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    .music-btn:hover {
      background: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--primary);
    }

    .stage {
      display: none;
      animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease forwards;
    }

    .stage.active {
      display: block;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .stage-box {
      background: rgba(10, 2, 8, 0.85);
      border-radius: 15px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 30, 86, 0.3);
      padding: 22px;
      text-align: left;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .stage-title {
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
      display: block;
    }

    .dare-box {
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 12px 15px;
      background: rgba(255, 30, 86, 0.15);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-reveal {
      background: linear-gradient(45deg, #a70032, var(--accent));
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(255, 0, 85, 0.5);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .btn-reveal:hover {
      transform: scale(1.03);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(255, 0, 85, 0.8);
    }

    .signature {
      text-align: right;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-top: 15px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  </style>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

  <div class="glow"></div>
  <div class="bg-particles" id="particleContainer"></div>

  <audio id="bgMusic" loop>
    <source src="https://www.soundhelix.com/examples/mp3/SoundHelix-Song-1.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
  </audio>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="central-glow"></div>

    <h1>Happy Birthday, Gorgeous 🔥</h1>
    <p class="tagline">November 27th belongs strictly to us...</p>

    <div class="music-control">
      <button class="music-btn" onclick="toggleAudio()">🎵 Play / Pause Vibe</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Stage 1 -->
    <div class="stage active" id="stage1">
      <div class="stage-box">
        <span class="stage-title">Stage I — The Whisper</span>
        <p>Before the night unravels, I need to confess something to you...</p>
        <p>From the moment you walk into a room, everything else fades out. You possess a dark, magnetic spell over me that I never want to break.</p>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-reveal" onclick="nextStage(2)">Unlock Stage II 🗝️</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Stage 2 -->
    <div class="stage" id="stage2">
      <div class="stage-box">
        <span class="stage-title">Stage II — The Temptation</span>
        <p>You aren't just beautiful—you are an absolute addiction.</p>
        <p>Your laugh, your scent, the subtle touch of your skin, and the secret looks you give me... they set my mind on fire and make it impossible to think about anything else.</p>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-reveal" onclick="nextStage(3)">Step Deeper 💋</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Stage 3 -->
    <div class="stage" id="stage3">
      <div class="stage-box">
        <span class="stage-title">Stage III — The Fantasy</span>
        <p>Tonight, the outside world ceases to exist.</p>
        <p>No distractions, no interruptions. Just you, me, and the dangerous friction between us. Today is entirely dedicated to worshiping you, spoiling you, and satisfying every single desire you have hidden away.</p>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-reveal" onclick="nextStage(4)">Uncover More 🔥</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Stage 4 -->
    <div class="stage" id="stage4">
      <div class="stage-box">
        <span class="stage-title">Stage IV — The Climax</span>
        <p>Close your eyes for a second and imagine this: just the two of us behind locked doors, my hands tracing every curve of your body, and your breath getting heavier against my neck.</p>
        <p>I want to taste every inch of you, listen to you whisper my name, and completely lose control together until morning.</p>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-reveal" onclick="nextStage(5)">The Final Command 🍷</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Stage 5 -->
    <div class="stage" id="stage5">
      <div class="stage-box">
        <span class="stage-title">Stage V — The Ultimate Vow</span>
        <p>Happy Birthday to my absolute obsession. Your gift is waiting, and it starts the moment you look at me and say you're ready.</p>
        <p>Drop your phone, come find me, and let's make tonight unforgettable. 😉🔥</p>
        
        <div class="dare-box">
          🔥 <strong>DARE:</strong> I dare you to come over right now and let me show you what happens when we lock the door and leave no distance between us... if you think you can handle me tonight. 💋
        </div>

        <div class="signature">Yours completely, ❤️</div>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-reveal" onclick="nextStage(1)">Replay Our Journey ↺</button>
    </div>

  </div>

  <script>
    const audio = document.getElementById('bgMusic');
    
    function toggleAudio() {
      if (audio.paused) {
        audio.play();
      } else {
        audio.pause();
      }
    }

    function nextStage(stageNum) {
      if (stageNum > 5) stageNum = 1;

      const stages = document.querySelectorAll('.stage');
      stages.forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));

      const current = document.getElementById('stage' + stageNum);
      current.classList.add('active');

      audio.play().catch(() => {});
    }

    const container = document.getElementById('particleContainer');
    const symbols = ['🔥', '💋', '❤️', '✨', '🥀'];

    for (let i = 0; i < 30; i++) {
      const p = document.createElement('div');
      p.className = 'particle';
      p.innerText = symbols[Math.floor(Math.random() * symbols.length)];
      p.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';
      p.style.animationDelay = Math.random() * 5 + 's';
      p.style.animationDuration = (Math.random() * 3 + 4) + 's';
      container.appendChild(p);
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
